;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\竹林黒霧.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜バギー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>The word 'witch' again...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
One time it's the priests of the Arata settlement, another time it's my intuition being called a witch's power...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And now it's a witch who gave an oracle about the curse-killings...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This one word has far too many meanings, and it's confusing me.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Who's the witch!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"The witch means <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-chan</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Sakura-chan</STYLE> tells us the culprit who'll cause the curse-killing. 
{PAUSE ""}
So whoever appears at the place named in the <STYLE ID="2">witch</STYLE>'s oracle, the people of the settlement '<STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ささ">offer</STYLE> up'..."<PG>
That's crazy...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, could it be that the curse-killings... 
{PAUSE ""}
are cases where the people of the settlement killed the 'culprit' just as the witch's oracle said!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
They're committing curse-killings to prevent curse-killings...!?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">! That's not right!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Then that makes everyone in the settlement a culprit in the curse-killings!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I know that. Everyone knows it... 
{PAUSE ""}
But if <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> were one of the settlement's people, what would you do? Would you refuse to offer up the culprit?
{PAUSE ""}
　And then could <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> go on living in the settlement?"<PG>
I was left speechless.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's what the curse-killings really are: distrust breeds distrust, and to wipe it away, people kill whoever has become the target.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He hadn't said 'kill,' but 'offer up' = 'kill' must be what he means.<PG>
All they'd have to do is stop the curse-killing just once...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be... that Shirozaki-san has 'offered up' a culprit too?<PG>
"That's why, in the settlement, anyone with a witch's power is shunned. 
{PAUSE ""}
Our aim isn't to catch the culprit in the curse-killings. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's to kill the 'witch' who brings the oracles of curses...!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wait, hold on...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is that a death threat from Shirozaki-san against me...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If things go wrong, who knows what the residents will do to me in the settlement.<PG>
Going back to the settlement like this is dangerous...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could even be killed as a witch, just like that!<PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "30" "30" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Let me off!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ナイフを構える.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\ナイフ横.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "300" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I put the knife to Shirozaki-san's throat.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had to get away from here, fast...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But Shirozaki-san made no move to slow the buggy down.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"If you don't hurry...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="6">I'll really stab you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{MOTION "789" "アイテム2" "3" "200" "200" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I pressed the blade hard against Shirozaki-san's neck.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It might have cut his skin a little.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... if he still won't let me off, I'll really...!<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, that's what the curse-killing really is."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "5000" "PASS"}
"That's what's causing the curse-killing."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is he suddenly saying...!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is he trying to confuse me by saying strange things...!?<PG>
"Like that, you stop being able to trust your neighbors. 
{PAUSE ""}
You get <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="つ">possessed</STYLE> by paranoia that the person in front of you might kill you... 
{PAUSE ""}
and given any excuse, you try to wipe out that fear―in other words, you try to strike first. 
{PAUSE ""}
Which is exactly what <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>'re trying to do right now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギーアイドリング.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Suddenly the buggy stopped.<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, if you're still worried, you can get off here. 
{PAUSE ""}
There's no such thing as a curse-killer. People shake off whatever threatens them so they won't become victims. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's just self-defense... no, excessive self-defense, I guess..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">then why doesn't everyone stop, when they know!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　There's no curse-killer, right!? You just kill people who might be the culprit because you're scared, right!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Then...!"</STYLE><PG>
"Don't you see how dangerous it is to say that out loud?
{PAUSE ""}
　In a way, that's covering for the curse-killer. 
{PAUSE ""}
Either you kill whoever might be the curse-killer, or you get killed yourself..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"But, I mean...! There's </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s oracle, isn't there!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Whoever's faking it is the real culprit, right!?"</STYLE><PG>
"Sorry, the oracle story was a lie. 
{PAUSE ""}
I wanted you to experience for yourself what state of mind you end up in when you're caught up in the curse-killings."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Suddenly telling me it was a lie...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't tell whether even that is a lie...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Lying twice over like that, when the truth is!<PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>, I know what <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>'re thinking. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE> must be tangled up in cursed thinking you can't break free of. 
{PAUSE ""}
After only a few hours here, a person ends up like <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
So even <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> can imagine what becomes of people caught up in this incident for 10 years..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sure, their suspicion would feed on itself far more than mine.<PG>
Even now, I can't trust Shirozaki-san with all my heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the fact that he's telling me all this... 
{PAUSE ""}
could also be taken as an SOS from Shirozaki-san.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then... why don't you run away, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　If it's this dangerous here, then right away―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE> might not understand... 
{PAUSE ""}
Everyone in this settlement was born and raised in this settlement. 
{PAUSE ""}
How much loss comes with giving that up, how much humiliation."<PG>
"Though I guess that doesn't really click for you. 
{PAUSE ""}
For example, the trouble over evicting residents when a railroad gets built, 
{PAUSE ""}
territorial disputes between countries, 
{PAUSE ""}
indigenous peoples rejecting civilization, 
{PAUSE ""}
wars of conquest to expand territory. 
{PAUSE ""}
Places, back then and now, are assets that give rise to a lot of conflict and fighting. 
{PAUSE ""}
For rooted residents like us, Arata is a place we have to protect even if we die for it."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Honestly, it doesn't feel real to me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I figured. I know just how you feel, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
But... 
{PAUSE ""}
even so, we can't forgive them. Anyone who threatens Arata. 
{PAUSE ""}
No matter what happens, I'll protect this settlement to the end."<PG>
"I'm on my own now, and the only thing I have left to lose is this place called Arata. 
{PAUSE ""}
Everyone else is a lot older than <STYLE ID="8">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> too, and they've probably decided to stick it out here. 
{PAUSE ""}
So I'll protect this place our ancestors handed down to us, even if it costs my life."<PG>
There was an attachment to this place that I couldn't understand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understand that much, but―
{PAUSE ""}
do I really need to step into a place like that too?<PG>
"So, what'll it be? Head on to the settlement, or get off here?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I run away here, at least I might be saved.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... that would be the same as leaving <STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE> to die.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way I could...<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
Just then, my phone vibrated.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seemed there was still a faint signal.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Keeping the knife on Shirozaki-san, I took out my phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ赤ストラップ入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "100" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
It was a message from <STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="12">“You must be uneasy, but trust </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">your own</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> intuition. </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="12"> should be in no danger.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE> had been listening to this whole conversation too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't want to think <STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE> would throw me into a dangerous place.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I was the one who said I'd come here, even overruling <STYLE ID="11">Dad</STYLE> and Mom.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n540\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nアイテム2\r\n4\r\n540\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">To the settlement, please..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"I see... 
{PAUSE ""}
You got it, <STYLE ID="1">missy</STYLE>! I'm counting on you!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\バギー運転中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "800" "1000" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田山道夜バギー.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The 'nerves of steel' <STYLE ID="9">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="10">Goto</STYLE> had talked about were pointlessly kicking in now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly, I'm scared and I want to run away, but...<PG>
Besides, there were the figures I'd seen earlier who looked like <STYLE ID="14">Kotaro-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Sakura-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have a duty to pass this on.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
